#: _inc/lib/core-api/class.jetpack-core-api-module-endpoints.php:1694
msgid "Your site is verified with %s."
msgstr "Сайт проверен с помощью %s."

#: _inc/lib/core-api/class.jetpack-core-api-module-endpoints.php:1654
#: _inc/lib/core-api/class.jetpack-core-api-module-endpoints.php:1685
